                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I am working hard to expand the VA\u2019s presence in South Texas.\n\nOur veterans shouldn\u2019t have to travel for hours or wait for months to receive treatment.\n\nI was pleased to ask @SecVetAffairs today how the VA is working to ensure every South Texas veteran has access to healthcare. https://t.co/XudZML5YKe",
