                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I announced $2 million in federal funding over five years for the Veterans Treatment Program based in Webb County. \n \nThis funding will benefit veterans across South Texas, including those in Webb County and five of its neighboring rural counties including Zapata, Jim Hogg, Starr, Duval, and Jim Wells. \n \nThis funding will provide mental health counseling for substance abuse disorders and PTSD for over 200 veterans across South Texas.\n \nI am dedicated to improving access to these crucial services and will continue advocating for our veterans in Congress.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1726260152,
                "view_count": 402
            },
