                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Yesterday, I had the chance to visit the ROOTS Recovery Center, a facility I\u2019m deeply proud to support. I secured $2,000,000 in federal funding for the City of Laredo Detoxification Center, now known as ROOTS, to ensure our community has access to the critical addiction treatment services we need. This funding supports staff salaries and essential resources, including electronic medical records, healthcare supplies, and food\u2014resources that directly impact the care and well-being of those struggling with addiction.\n\nDuring my tour, I had the opportunity to meet with patients and hear their personal stories. It was incredibly moving to witness their resilience and determination as they work toward recovery. ROOTS provides 24/7 medical detoxification services, crisis stabilization, and comprehensive support to help patients through their journey. It\u2019s a place where people can find hope, healing, and the help they need to rebuild their lives. I\u2019m truly committed to supporting ROOTS and the vital work they do every day to make a difference in people\u2019s lives.",
